## Changelog & collaboration

- Update **`CHANGELOG.md`** per **`changelog.mdc`** in the same session as substantive work unless the user opts out.
- Externalize reasoning per documentation rules before merge; ask before large refactors. Align new scrapers with **`de_scraping_pipeline.py`** and `src/` layout.
